# kin/child/head/pointed: the child's Pointed head: wide cheeks narrowing to a pointed chin a row lower (heart-shaped); the profile's chin pushed forward. A3's eye rows and the mouth row kept. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# white and glint), a 1 px mouth; the side views a round skull with a soft snub profile (KIN-CHILD; the front first drawn
# in the slice). Hair, brows, nose and ears are their own parts. Every child head keeps the eye rows and columns, the
# nose pixel and the mouth row (expressions fit them all). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body child
role head pointed
layer head
anchor head
keys rest

